<title>USA: Trenwick Group makes three-for-two split.</title>
<headline>Trenwick Group makes three-for-two split.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trenwick Group Inc said Thursday its board of directors had approved a three-for-two split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company, a reinsurer for property casualties, said it would make the distribution on April 15 to shareholders of record on March 18.</p>
<p>The board also declared a 16-percent increase in its quarterly dividend to $0.36 a share, it said.</p>
<p>On December 31, the company had 6.8 million weighted average shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
